 \"name\": \"Tata Motors EV\"\n        },\n        \"offers\": {\n           \"@type\": \"Offer\", \n           \"priceSpecification\": {\n              \"@type\": \"PriceSpecification\",\n              \"price\": \"799000\",\n              \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n            },\n           \"url\": \"https://evindia.online/product/tata-motors-ev-tiago-xe-19.2-kwh\",\n           \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/PreOrder\" \n        }\n        ,\n          \"aggregateRating\": {\n            \"@type\": \"AggregateRating\",\n            \"ratingValue\": \"4.2\",\n            \"bestRating\": \"5\",\n            \"worstRating\": \"1\",\n            \"ratingCount\": \"15\",\n            \"reviewCount\": \"15\"\n          },\n          \"review\": [{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Vijay\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The single biggest disappointment is the lack of rear power windows and central locking controls inside the car. These are basic features I missed from my old car, even at this low price point.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.9,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Hiral\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"A brilliant second car for the household. It allows us to keep the main petrol SUV for long trips while handling all the polluting and expensive daily city chores cleanly and affordably.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.7,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Himanshu\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"This car is strictly a short-distance commuter. The focus on cost means missing features like cruise control, which makes it less comfortable for any occasional highway run.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.4,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Chetna\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The 8-year/1,60,000 km battery warranty is the most reassuring aspect. It's a commitment from Tata that the battery will last, securing my low running costs for years to come.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.4,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Sunil\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The lack of an infotainment system is tough, but the money I saved allowed me to put in a good aftermarket head unit with a reverse camera. A workaround for the missing tech features.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.8,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Ritu Aggarwal\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The car's compact size (3.77m length) makes parking in tight spots incredibly easy. The tight turning radius is a huge advantage for maneuvering in crowded urban areas.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.8,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Amitabh Singh\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"I love the efficiency features like Regenerative Braking (4 levels). It makes driving engaging and dramatically improves range in stop-and-go city traffic conditions.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Divya Rao\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"I chose the 19.2 kWh battery over the Long Range option purely for the savings. For a budget buyer who doesn't do highway trips, the Medium Range offers the most bang for the buck.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.7,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Manish Hegde\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The single biggest disappointment is the lack of rear power windows and central locking controls inside the car. These are basic features I missed from my old car, even at this low price point.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.9,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Kavita Joshi\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The car feels sturdy, and even the base model includes Disc brakes (Front), ABS, and 2 airbags. It's built on a reliable Tata platform, giving confidence in daily usage.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.5,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Gaurav Taneja\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"Charging via the standard 15A socket takes nearly 7 hours (10-100%), which is a long time. However, the option for 25 kW DC fast charging (10-80% in 58 mins) is a fantastic safety net for emergencies.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.2,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Neha Singh\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"As the base model, it lacks a music system, but it includes the crucial Automatic Climate Control and Digital Instrument Cluster. These features are highly essential for comfort and information.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.9,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Rajesh Varma\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The acceleration (0-60 km/h in 6.2 seconds) is snappy! The instant torque from the 45 kW motor makes driving in traffic feel effortless and fun. It definitely feels like a \\\"pocket rocket\\\" in the city.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.6,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Anjali Saxena\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The 19.2 kWh battery is perfectly sized for city use. I get a real-world range of about 170-190 km, which is more than enough for my local runs. It’s light, quick, and economical.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.6,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Prakash Rawat\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"At ₹7.99 Lakh, it's the gateway to EV ownership! The price point is fantastic for a car with a 250 km certified range. It's the most affordable way to eliminate petrol bills entirely.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}}]\n        \n      },\n      {\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n        \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n        \"itemListElement\": [\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 1,\n            \"name\": \"Home\",\n            \"item\": \"https://evindia.online/\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 2,\n            \"name\": \"Tata Motors EV\",\n            \"item\": \"https://evindia.online/electric-vehicle-companies/tata-motors-ev\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 3,\n            \"name\": \"Tiago XE (19.2 kWh)\",\n            \"item\": \"https://evindia.online/product/tata-motors-ev-tiago-xe-19.2-kwh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]","webPageSchema":"{\n      \"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\":\"WebPage\",\n      \"name\":\"Tata Tiago XE (19.2 kWh): Price, Range, Images, Features | EVINDIA\",\n      \"description\": \"Tata Tiago XE (19.2 kWh) price starting from Rs 799000. Explore Tata Tiago XE (19.2 kWh): Latest offers, Specifications, Models, Colors. Get showroom address, contact number, location and more at EVINDIA.\",\n      \"url\": \"https://evindia.o